  "notes": [
   "The order code is IL300, then an optional K3 bin group (DEFG, EF, E, F or G), then an optional package option (X0##) and a trailing T for tape and reel. Every part is certified to UL, cUL, BSI, FIMKO and CQC; codes with option 1 (X001, X016, X017) add DIN EN 60747-5-5 (VDE 0884-5).",
   "Codes whose packing reads \"tape and reel; also tubes\" are also sold in tubes, ordered without the final T.",
   "Every IL300 is sorted into one K3 bin, lettered A to J, and the letter is marked on the part. Tubes hold 50 parts of one bin, and the tube label carries the bin. A plain IL300 order may ship any of the ten bins.",
   "Ordering figures: DIP-8 row spacing 7.62 mm; option 6 10.55 mm; option 7 body > 0.7 mm above the board; option 9 > 0.18 mm."
  ]
 },
